<title>PORTUGAL: SOCCER-TOP PORTUGUESE GOAL SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TOP PORTUGUESE GOAL SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Top goal scorers in the Portuguese first division at the end of the season on Sunday:</p>
<p>30 - Mario Jardel (Porto)</p>
<p>20 - Jerrel Jimmy (Boavista)</p>
<p>16 - Erik Gaucho (Estrela Amadora)</p>
<p>15 - Constantino Jardim (Leca)</p>
<p>15 - Nuno Gomes (Boavista)</p>
<p>14 - Mladen Karoglan (Braga)</p>
<p>13 - Gilmar Estevan (Guimaraes)</p>
<p>12 - Edmilson Lucena (Maritimo)</p>
